                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A41a/3: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-12T18:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 12—9:58
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>293. Your 151, September 10, 3 p.m.<anchor n="78" xml:id="d83-f1"/> Foreign
                    Office inquire what is meant by phrase “Status of Existing Commitments”.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
